Description: Report the real release version
 Upstream tagged v1.0.0 but left MANALYZE_VERSION defined as "0.9", so the
 binary identifies itself as 0.9 in --version output and in report headers.
 That makes it impossible to tell from the tool's own output which build is
 installed, and it causes bug reports to be filed against the wrong version.
Author: REMnux Distribution <distro@remnux.org>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-08-02

--- a/include/manalyze_version.h
+++ b/include/manalyze_version.h
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
 #pragma once
 
-#define MANALYZE_VERSION "0.9"
+#define MANALYZE_VERSION "1.0.0"
